# zsets1 — a leaderboard with ZADD and ZINCRBY
#
# Learn: a sorted set keeps each member with a numeric score, ordered by
# score. ZADD sets a score (overwriting), ZINCRBY adds to it, and
# ZADD ... GT only updates when the new score is greater (a "best score").
#
# Task: on the leaderboard lb:weekly
#   - ada just earned 50 points (add them to whatever she has),
#   - bob finished a game with 85 points; keep it only if it beats his
#     best so far,
#   - newcomer cy starts with 30.
# The check runs this against different leaderboards.
#

ZADD lb:weekly 170 ada
ZADD lb:weekly 85 bob
ZADD lb:weekly 30 cy
